From: HDSatelit
Subject: [PATCH] GStreamer: cere gl si mpegts numai cand optiunile lor sunt pornite

Cu ENABLE_VIDEO=ON, GStreamerChecks.cmake pune mereu componentele "mpegts" si "gl" in lista ceruta la
find_package(GStreamer ... REQUIRED), chiar daca USE_GSTREAMER_MPEGTS=OFF si USE_GSTREAMER_GL=OFF.
FindGStreamer.cmake le face atunci obligatorii (REQUIRED_VARS) si configurarea cade pe un sysroot fara
gstreamer-gl-1.0 (gst-plugins-base construit fara OpenGL, ca al receptorului). La legare WebKit le
foloseste oricum numai cu optiunile pornite (Source/WebCore/platform/GStreamer.cmake), deci se cer la fel.

--- a/Source/cmake/GStreamerChecks.cmake
+++ b/Source/cmake/GStreamerChecks.cmake
@@ -9,7 +9,15 @@
       else ()
           set(GSTREAMER_COMPONENTS app pbutils)
           if (ENABLE_VIDEO)
-              list(APPEND GSTREAMER_COMPONENTS video mpegts tag gl)
+              list(APPEND GSTREAMER_COMPONENTS video tag)
+          endif ()
+
+          if (USE_GSTREAMER_MPEGTS)
+              list(APPEND GSTREAMER_COMPONENTS mpegts)
+          endif ()
+
+          if (USE_GSTREAMER_GL)
+              list(APPEND GSTREAMER_COMPONENTS gl)
           endif ()

           if (ENABLE_WEB_AUDIO)
